{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a thrilling adventure with <strong>Claudinho</strong>, a brave little cloud fighting to protect the Amazon Rainforest from wildfires!<br><strong>A Clareira</strong> is a colorful 2D <strong>shoot 'em up</strong> game where you throw raindrops to put out fires and overcome obstacles across increasingly challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Lovingly crafted by local artists, featuring visuals inspired by the Amazon\u2019s unique wildlife, plants, and culture;<br>\u2605 Simple and intuitive gameplay with progressive difficulty that challenges reflexes and strategy;<br>\u2605 Packed with environmental facts to raise awareness in a fun and educational way;<br>\u2605 Perfect for all ages \u2014 easy to pick up, hard to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Claudinho and help protect the forest \u2014 do you have what it takes?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560900?t=1757983389","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560900/118beb579b5fab65f46f0dc1e8680c15a475f42c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757983389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560900/6a1ed73293c41b2e1a2b65f170f086d79312b2d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757983389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560900/6a1ed73293c41b2e1a2b65f170f086d79312b2d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757983389","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a thrilling adventure with <strong>Claudinho</strong>, a brave little cloud fighting to protect the Amazon Rainforest from wildfires!<br><strong>A Clareira</strong> is a colorful 2D <strong>sh